                    "value": "<p>he pilot deploys magnetized steel walls that extend from the sea fort's sides, increasing its height to 60 feet. The ramparts have an AC of 20, Hardness 10, and 80 HP (BT 40). Thanks to the magnetic runes, metal projectiles fired at the sea fort strike the ramparts first and can't damage the ship itself until they're broken. The sea fort can Raise Ramparts only while its swim Speed is 0, and Raise Ramparts can't be active at the same time as Extended Blockade. If the ramparts are destroyed, Raise Ramparts can't be used until they're repaired.</p>"
